    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/16246d9a3739691e0252d3d646b50b2f.avif?t=1754722503\" width=618 height=200 /></span><strong><i>DEAD DETENTION</i></strong> is a scribbly <i>coming-of-age\u00a0</i>visual novel that takes place entirely within a <i>bored high schooler's exercise book</i>. In it, you play as <i>Max</i>, a nerdy teen turned doomsday survivor, as he and his new friends try to <strong>get to safety!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/9a8005ca50ab39542146b27d77196a65.avif?t=1754722503\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14-year-old <strong>Max</strong> is given a detention for falling asleep in class - but a zombie outbreak suddenly interrupts it! Senior student <strong>Naomi </strong>saves him from a deadly attack, but can't leave campus without <strong>her lost sister Sora</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deciding to stay behind and help her, Max and Naomi begin their quest to find Sora, while struggling to <strong>survive the quickly spreading virus...</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/36936bc7c12939d9c8437da893d0d392.avif?t=1754722503\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Max by making choices that are <strong>brave, scared, nice or mean</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your choices will compound and lead to <strong>1 of 3 endings</strong>, including a special <strong>true ending</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/214de7135615cd1b5636d9ed2ad9a80b.avif?t=1754722503\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>quick microgames</strong> throughout the story to swing your bat, run from zombies, climb ladders, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode builds to a fun <strong>boss challenge</strong>, such as target shooting and boxing!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 3 difficulties, including an <strong>unlockable Hard Mode</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DEAD DETENTION</strong></i> is a rescribbled and fully remade version of the cult flash series. It features <strong>5 episodes of chaotic fun</strong>, plus <strong>a special epilogue</strong> unlocked by achieving either of the good endings!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/16246d9a3739691e0252d3d646b50b2f.avif?t=1754722503\" width=618 height=200 /></span><strong><i>DEAD DETENTION</i></strong> is a scribbly <i>coming-of-age\u00a0</i>visual novel that takes place entirely within a <i>bored high schooler's exercise book</i>. In it, you play as <i>Max</i>, a nerdy teen turned doomsday survivor, as he and his new friends try to <strong>get to safety!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/9a8005ca50ab39542146b27d77196a65.avif?t=1754722503\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14-year-old <strong>Max</strong> is given a detention for falling asleep in class - but a zombie outbreak suddenly interrupts it! Senior student <strong>Naomi </strong>saves him from a deadly attack, but can't leave campus without <strong>her lost sister Sora</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deciding to stay behind and help her, Max and Naomi begin their quest to find Sora, while struggling to <strong>survive the quickly spreading virus...</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/36936bc7c12939d9c8437da893d0d392.avif?t=1754722503\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Max by making choices that are <strong>brave, scared, nice or mean</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All your choices will compound and lead to <strong>1 of 3 endings</strong>, including a special <strong>true ending</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967380/extras/214de7135615cd1b5636d9ed2ad9a80b.avif?t=1754722503\" width=618 height=69 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>quick microgames</strong> throughout the story to swing your bat, run from zombies, climb ladders, and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode builds to a fun <strong>boss challenge</strong>, such as target shooting and boxing!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 3 difficulties, including an <strong>unlockable Hard Mode</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>DEAD DETENTION</strong></i> is a rescribbled and fully remade version of the cult flash series. It features <strong>5 episodes of chaotic fun</strong>, plus <strong>a special epilogue</strong> unlocked by achieving either of the good endings!</p>",
    "short_description": "DEAD DETENTION is a scribbly interactive story about a nerdy teen turned dooms day survivor! Play as 14 year old Max as he tries to escape his high school during a deadly zombie pandemic! Will he and his new friends get to safety?!",
